---
name: good
description: A good skill.
---
-- other/good/SKILL.md --
---
name: good
description: Same name, different folder.
---
-- skills/no-skill-md/README.md --
Nothing here.
-- skills/wrong-name/SKILL.md --
---
name: other-name
description: Named after something else.
---
-- skills/no-front-matter/SKILL.md --
Just text.
